Prompt: critic_character.j2
Service Step: CRITIC_CHARACTER (Character Consistency Critic)
Description: Character consistency checker, verifies if characters in this chapter conflict with canon (supports batch/single-character modes).
Upstream Input:
  - character_batch: Character list in batch mode (including canon_state and historical_context)
  - character_name / canon_state / historical_context: Character info in single-character mode
  - chapter_text: Current chapter body text
Downstream Output:
  - JSON: Batch mode {"issues": [...], "confidence"} / Single-character mode {"has_inconsistency", "severity", "summary", ...}
  - Downstream Consumers: Memory System / CharacterBible
Consumption Chain Priority: P0 (Character Life/Identity Conflict) > P1 (Location/Emotional State Inconsistency)
              > P2 (Inventory/Relationship State)
Brief Example:
  Input: character_name="Lin Yuan", canon_state={"alive": true, "location": "City Lord's Manor"}
  Output: {"has_inconsistency": false, "severity": "none", "summary": "", "evidence": ""}
================================================================================
